1
00:00:00,663 --> 00:00:03,703
(Leslie:)...and who better to slow things down with
than you?

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,330
(Leonard:)I'm flattered.

3
00:00:07,837 --> 00:00:10,337
(Leonard:)So how do you suggest we proceed?

4
00:00:10,506 --> 00:00:14,006
(Leslie:)Your place. We'll order Chinese.
You'll rent a movie, artsy but accessible.

5
00:00:14,176 --> 00:00:16,176
(Leslie:)Then light petting, no coitus.

6
00:00:17,721 --> 00:00:20,721
- Sounds fun.
- I'll leave the details up to you.

7
00:00:20,891 --> 00:00:24,021
(Leslie:)I think it's better
if you assume the male role.

8
00:00:25,688 --> 00:00:27,688
(Leonard:)Thank you, that's very thoughtful.

9
00:00:28,149 --> 00:00:29,859
(Leslie:)Great.

10
00:00:30,025 --> 00:00:31,695
(Leslie:)Call me.

11
00:00:37,533 --> 00:00:41,073
Hey, great news.
My mom sent me my old Nintendo 64.

12
00:00:41,245 --> 00:00:42,455
LEONARD:
Oh.

13
00:00:43,956 --> 00:00:46,166
- Terrific.
- You know what this means, don't you?

14
00:00:46,333 --> 00:00:50,543
(Sheldon:)Break out the Red Bull.
It's time to rock "Mario" old school.

15
00:00:51,922 --> 00:00:54,382
- I kind of have other plans tonight.
- But it's Friday.

16
00:00:54,550 --> 00:00:58,260
Friday's always vintage-game night.
Look, Mom included the memory card.

17
00:00:58,429 --> 00:01:03,019
We can pick up right where I left off
in 1999 when I had pernicious anemia.

